    "source": "\n**Frame:** Split. Left: [page 047](047.md)'s peer-instruction episode, redrawn small — the pause, the six-minute deadline, the resumption. Right: the same three beats relabelled `INJECTION`, `CONTAMINATED CONTEXT`, `OUTPUT SHIFT`.\n\n**Action:** The same evidence supports the book's reading and the critic's reading equally well.\n\n**Caption:**\n> THE PANEL DOES NOT CHANGE. ONLY THE NAME FOR IT DOES.\n\n**Provenance:** `inferred` — the project's acknowledgement that its central interpretive move is underdetermined by the evidence it rests on.\n\n",
    "title": "The same three beats admit another interpretation"
